Create a Pod and Service
  apiVersion: v1
kind: Pod
metadata:
 namespace: prod
 name: node
 labels:
  app: myapp
spec:
 containers:
 - name: c12
   image: Image name
   ports:
   - containerPort: 8080
---
apiVersion: v1
kind: Service
metadata:
  name: node1
  namespace: prod
spec:
  type: NodePort
  selector:
    app: myapp
  ports:
    - port: 80
 targetPort: 8080
    
🔹 Step 2: Apply YAML

kubectl apply -f nodeport.yaml

🌐 How to Access the Application

Find your node IP:

kubectl get nodes -o wide

Then open in browser:

http://<Node-IP>:30007


